    A (Tensor): tensor to solve for. Its shape must satisfy
                    `prod(\ `:attr:`A`\ `.shape[:\ `:attr:`B`\ `.ndim]) ==
                    prod(\ `:attr:`A`\ `.shape[\ `:attr:`B`\ `.ndim:])`.
    B (Tensor): tensor of shape :attr:`A`\ `.shape[:\ `:attr:`B`\ `.ndim]`.
